            "review_title": "Review at Press Station",
            "review_text": "arthurs5\nSydney, Australia110 contributions\n0\nA train goes around and around\nMay 2017 • Couples\nThe fascination of this place is that it has a large model train that goes on tracks around the walls and through the restaurant. It also has other memorabilia or bric a brac that I guess supports its name \"Press Station\". You can't actually play with the model train (well I assume so I never asked), but I think kids would like it none the less.The food we had was good and and compared with other restaurants on the other side of the park was well priced`. It does say it specializes in ribs, steaks and claypots, but we just had some standard Vietnamese fare.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 11, 2017",
